      "diff": "moderate",
      "format": "single",
      "topic": "sampling-t6",
      "stem": "Under PPSWOR, the HT estimator is:",
      "options": [
        "Σ y_i p_i",
        "Σ y_i/π_i",
        "(1/n)Σ y_i/p_i over draws",
        "Σ π_i/y_i"
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "HT uses final first-order inclusion probabilities."
    },
    {
      "0": "PPSWR can produce repeated selections.",
